	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nobis vero omnium longe gratissimi fuerunt hospites<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p2258">Joseph Macarius</persName> und seine Reisegenossen, die von <persName ref="p8011">Rudolf Gwalther</persName>, <persName ref="p7228">Huldrych Zwingli d.J.</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName> und <persName ref="p4851">Christoph Froschauer</persName> am 22. Juni 1544 nach <placeName ref="l257">Konstanz</placeName> begleitet wurden <hi>(<persName ref="p8127">Pellikan</persName>,</hi> Chronikon 162), wo sie wohl am 23. Juni eintrafen.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quos nobis commendasti<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Der entsprechende Brief <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> ist nicht erhalten.</note>, prius etiam multis nominibus commen<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>datissimos.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quod ad me sane attinet, alieno nonnihil tempore <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>advenerunt, quo uxorcula charissima<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="3"><persName ref="p4321">Katharina, geb. Ryff</persName>.</note> graviter decubuit, postquam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>duobus mensibus uterum se ferre existimans menstruorum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>fluxum magno<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Vor</hi> magno <hi>gestrichenes</hi> g[...].</note> periculo est passa, ut nihil officii in <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nostris ędibus optimis et suavissimis hominibus praestare potuerim.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/><persName ref="p2258">Iosephus <span type="pronoun">ille</span> Macarius</persName>, pientissimus ac doctus adulescens, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>hęrebit etiamnum diebus aliquot,<pb type="edition" next="298"/><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Zu <persName ref="p2258">Macarius</persName>' Reise s. oben <ref target="file11973">Nr. 1926</ref>, Anm. 1.</note> utinam cum fructu aliquo!</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/><persName ref="p2095">Philippi</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p2095">Philipp Melanchthon</persName>.</note> animum candidissimum erga nostra ecclesias, ut vere <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>est, pleno testimonio indicavit, cui ipsi quoque scribemus<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Nicht erhalten.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Sed heus tu, mi venerande <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, quur nihil <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tu de meis ad te literis?</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Scripsi ad te 30. maii<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Oben <ref target="file11966">Nr. 1919</ref>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>et valde dolebit, si eas literas intelligam te non accepisse, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>deinde 17. iunii per <persName ref="p7242">Claudium Sabaudum</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p7242">Claude d'Aliod</persName>.</note>, cui Schwenck[feldianam] epistolam <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et Brunsvicensem caussam exhibendam tibi credidi;<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p8055">Blarers</persName> Brief vom 16. Juni (oben <ref target="file11975">Nr. 1928</ref>), der möglicherweise am 17. Juni abgeschickt wurde.</note> tu fac, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>me prima occasione angustiis istis liberes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Sororius meus <persName ref="p2300">Heinrichus ab Ulmis</persName> multis me heri <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>per epistolam rogavit,<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Nicht in <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> BW.</note> ut suo tibi nomine scribam, quo <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tuo et optimi consulis <persName ref="p2816">Röstii</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p2816">Diethelm Röist</persName>.</note> beneficio <persName ref="p8393">Hieronymus</persName> ille<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p8393">Hieronymus Kaufmann</persName>; s. oben <ref target="file11964">Nr. 1917</ref>, 67-73 mit Anm. 37.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>apud <placeName ref="l1414">Buͦch</placeName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><placeName ref="l1414">Buch am Irchel</placeName> (<placeName ref="l803">Kt. Zürich</placeName>).</note>, pastor ecclesię <placeName ref="l287">Lutmerckensis</placeName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="14"><placeName ref="l287">Leutmerken</placeName> (<placeName ref="l774">Kt. Thurgau</placeName>) nahe <placeName ref="l184">Grießenberg</placeName>, wo <persName ref="p8055">Blarers</persName> Schwager <persName ref="p2300">Heinrich von Ulm</persName> wohnte. Die Einsetzung erfolgte tatsächlich; s. <hi>Pfarrerbuch</hi> 373.</note> facta sibi a <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguricensibus</placeName> potestate inaugurari possit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Valde igitur te <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>per amicitiam nostram et christianę charitatis viscera obtestor<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Vor</hi> obtestor <hi>gestrichenes</hi> te.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ut hic non tam<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">tam <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> nobis quam Christi caussę adsis; plurimum enim <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>refert, qualis illic parochus siet, idque multas ob caussas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Salvere te reverenter in domino iubent germanus frater <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>meus <persName ref="p8178">Thomas</persName><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p8178">Thomas Blarer</persName>.</note> cum <persName ref="p4082">C[onrado] Z[viccio]</persName> et fratribus symmystis.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Tu ora pro nobis et tota domo dei<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><cit type="bible"><ref>1Tim 3, 15</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Comitia <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>finem<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Am 9. Juni fand die Abschlusssitzung des Reichstages zu <placeName ref="l471">Speyer</placeName> statt, der Reichstagsabschied datiert vom 10. Juni; s. RTA JR XV/1 142; RTA JR XV/4 2235-2285.</note> acceperunt data tolerabili pace religioni, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>sed quam solus Christus conservabit, quem mundus odit<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18"><cit type="bible"><ref>Joh 7, 7</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>15, 18.</ref></cit></note> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>et a quo nihil aliud, quam quod ipsius sit ingenium, expectabimus.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Sed fortior, qui in nobis, quam qui in mundo<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19"><cit type="bible"><ref>1Joh 4, 4</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Tu iterum et perpetuo vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l257">Constantiae</placeName>, 25. iunii 1544.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8055">Ambr. Blaurerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Expecto magno desiderio, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>quid de negocio<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20"><persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> bezieht sich wahrscheinlich auf den möglichen Anschluss von <placeName ref="l257">Konstanz</placeName> an die <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossenschaft</placeName>; s. zuletzt oben <ref target="file11966">Nr. 1919</ref>, 18-45.</note>, quod <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>nosti, scripturus sis<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Nicht erhalten; unten <ref target="file11995">Nr. 1948</ref> ist wohl die Antwort auf den verlorenen Brief.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Observando suo et <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>charissimo fratri <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
